 (Gamma, u:P(a,"refl"_a) tack J(u,a,"refl"_a) -= u:P(a, "refl"_a))
$

When doing mathematics using HoTT we will (almost) never talk about definitional equality between things.
We can see it more as a mechanism to reduce terms.

